    <section id="dm-profile" class="dm-message-section py-5">

        <div class="container">

            <div class="section-title text-center mb-5">

                <span class="section-badge">

                    Leadership

                </span>

                <h2>

                    Message from the District Magistrate

                </h2>

                <p>

                    Transforming public administration through innovation,
                    transparency and citizen-centric digital services.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="row align-items-center">

                <div class="col-lg-4">

                    <div class="profile-panel">

                        <img src="~/images/dm-vishak.jpeg"
                             class="img-fluid rounded-4 shadow-lg mb-4"
                             alt="District Magistrate">

                        <h3>

                            Shri Vishak G, IAS

                        </h3>

                        <h5>

                            District Magistrate, Lucknow

                        </h5>

                        <div class="mt-4">

                            <span class="profile-tag">

                                Indian Administrative Service

                            </span>

                            <span class="profile-tag">

                                Digital Governance

                            </span>

                            <span class="profile-tag">

                                Citizen First

                            </span>

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="col-lg-8">

                    <div class="message-card">

                        <i class="bi bi-quote quote-icon"></i>

                        <h4>

                            Towards Transparent & Technology Driven Governance

                        </h4>

                        <p>

                            The District Administration, Lucknow continues
                            to strengthen public service delivery through
                            adoption of modern digital technologies. The
                            Lucknow Bhulekh Portal represents an important
                            milestone in preserving valuable revenue records
                            while making authenticated information easily
                            accessible to citizens.

                        </p>

                        <p>

                            Digitisation improves transparency, minimizes
                            manual dependency, enables efficient record
                            management and supports faster delivery of
                            government services.

                        </p>

                        <p>

                            This initiative reflects our commitment towards
                            accountable governance, efficient administration
                            and a digitally empowered district.

                        </p>

                        <div class="signature-box">

                            <h5>

                                Shri Vishak G, IAS

                            </h5>

                            <span>

                                District Magistrate, Lucknow

                            </span>

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

