                            The Lucknow Bhulekh Portal is a district-level
                            digital initiative developed by the District
                            Administration, Lucknow for systematic
                            digitization, preservation and management of
                            historical land and revenue records.

                        </p>

                        <p>

                            The platform enables secure metadata entry,
                            verification, record preservation and
                            citizen-centric digital services while improving
                            transparency and administrative efficiency.

                        </p>

